{"parentUuid":"04eb227c-45e8-4158-bfde-d4f4a632e362","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6887a391-5aab-480d-82fd-e8fc638946f7","agentId":"a75edaef91da833a8","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GgxpPVAxU4XuRqaA999mJh","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"2025 Hyundai Kona Electric SEL Long Range 261 miles EPA 17 inch wheels\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"2025 Hyundai Kona Review, Pricing, and Specs | CARFAX\",\"url\":\"https://www.carfax.com/Research-2025-Hyundai-Kona_z40093\"},{\"title\":\"2025 Hyundai Kona Electric Road Test and Review | Autoweb\",\"url\":\"https://www.autoweb.com/2025-hyundai-kona-electric-road-test-and-review\"},{\"title\":\"Road Test: 2025 Hyundai Kona Electric | Clean Fleet Report\",\"url\":\"https://cleanfleetreport.com/road-test-2025-hyundai-kona-electric/\"},{\"title\":\"2025 Hyundai Kona Electric Prices, Reviews, and Pictures | Edmunds\",\"url\":\"https://www.edmunds.com/hyundai/kona-electric/\"},{\"title\":\"2025 Hyundai KONA Electric SEL - Specifications and price\",\"url\":\"https://www.evspecifications.com/en/model/dba636a\"},{\"title\":\"2025 Hyundai Kona Electric Review | Pricing, Trims & Photos - TrueCar\",\"url\":\"https://www.truecar.com/overview/hyundai/kona-electric/\"},{\"title\":\"2025 Kona Electric | SEL Trim Features | Hyundai USA\",\"url\":\"https://www.hyundaiusa.com/us/en/vehicles/kona-electric/sel\"},{\"title\":\"2025 Kona Electric | All-Electric SUV | Hyundai USA\",\"url\":\"https://www.hyundaiusa.com/us/en/vehicles/kona-electric\"},{\"title\":\"New 2025 Hyundai Kona Electric SEL Prices | Kelley Blue Book\",\"url\":\"https://www.kbb.com/hyundai/kona-electric/2025/sel/\"},{\"title\":\"Why the 2025 Hyundai Kona EV Might Be the Smartest Buy in Electric Cars | GreenCars\",\"url\":\"https://www.greencars.com/expert-insights/why-the-2025-hyundai-kona-ev-might-be-the-smartest-buy-in-electric-cars\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about the 2025 Hyundai Kona Electric SEL Long Range with 261 miles EPA range and 17-inch wheels:\n\n## Key Specifications\n\nThe SEL trim features a 64.8 kWh Long Range battery and a 150kW motor producing 201 horsepower and 188 pound-feet of torque, with a 261-mile EPA-estimated driving range.\n\nThe longest driving range of 261 miles comes from a Kona equipped with 17-inch wheels. The 17-inch alloy wheels are shod with EV-specific Kuhmo Solus 215/60 all-season tires, which are rated highest for rolling resistance, comfort and noise.\n\n## Features\n\nThe SEL model adds a power-adjustable driver's seat, heated front seats, rear-seat climate vents, and a leather-wrapped steering wheel. The Kona features dual 12.3-inch panoramic display screens with the left screen housing the digital meter and gauge cluster display, while the right side screen is the infotainment system.\n\n## Driving Experience\n\nEvery Kona Electric is front-wheel drive with no option for all-wheel drive. Hyundai says it takes 43 minutes to bring the Kona EV from a 10 percent charge to 80 percent using a public DC fast charging station.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"f7110bcb-7395-4a97-aee5-23bf1de9f63e","timestamp":"2026-04-25T01:22:14.478Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"04eb227c-45e8-4158-bfde-d4f4a632e362","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/ianmcadam/Documents/Claude/Projects/EV dashboard/.claude/worktrees/heuristic-jemison-71e592","sessionId":"d92199a2-b04d-4c16-8bc7-83b46b7a1128","version":"2.1.119","gitBranch":"claude/heuristic-jemison-71e592","slug":"this-project-was-being-gentle-adleman"}
